<title>UK: NordLB adds 500 mln marks to June 2000 bond. [corrected 10:50 gmt]</title>
<headline>NordLB adds 500 mln marks to June 2000 bond. [corrected 10:50 gmt]</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following jumbo Pfandbrief bond was increased to 3.1 billion marks from 2.6 (corrects from 2.5) billion marks, joint lead managers Bayerische Landesbank, Bankgesellschaft Berlin, Norddeutsche Landesbank, Salomon Brothers and Westdeutsche Landesbank said.</p>
<p>BORROWER   NORDDEUTSCHE LANDESBANK GZ</p>
<p>AMT    3.1 BLN DEM   COUPON     4.25	MATURITY    15.JUN.00</p>
<p>TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.355   PAY DATE   *02.MAY.97</p>
<p>FULL FEES  0.225     LISTING    HANN/FFT  PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p>MGT/UND    0.06	SELL CONC  0.165     DENOMS (K)  1</p>
<p>NOTES     *PLUS 317 DAYS ACCRUED INTEREST</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658 ENDS</p>
